# Garage -> Wasabi offsite copy of each bucket (Malaysia time).
# Enabled 2026-09-30, when Nextcloud moved to Garage. Before an app is cut
# over, keep its bucket out of offsite-sync.sh: until then Wasabi is its
# live storage, and a sync would delete from it what Garage doesn't have.
#
# Hourly: upload new and changed objects, never delete.
15 * * * * /usr/local/bin/offsite-sync.sh copy
# Nightly: also delete from Wasabi what was deleted in Garage (versioning
# on the Wasabi bucket keeps the deleted versions).
0 4 * * * /usr/local/bin/offsite-sync.sh sync
